{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20773","headline":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 一 · 卢仝","name":"常州孟谏议座上闻韩员外职方贬国子博士有感五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忽见除书到，韩君又学官。\n死生纵有命，人事始知难。\n烈火先烧玉，庭芜不养兰。\n山夫与刺史，相对两漓岏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20773.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20773","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}